L0747
@5:1
`Handle` declares `hook(drop)`, so it must say how it is copied
@4:2
`hook(drop)` is declared here
if a copy would release what the hook releases a second time, write `move_only` before `struct`
if a copy must do more than copy each field, declare `hook(copy)`
if copying each field is right, write `@(fieldwise_copy)` after `struct`
